From: Stained Glass OS <dev@stained-glass.example>
Subject: charmap: a system32 launcher for the App Paths Character Map

Windows has charmap.exe in system32; Wine has none. As 0120 does for
calc.exe, mspaint.exe and snippingtool.exe, charmap.exe (system32 and
syswow64) starts what App Paths registers for it -- sg-shell's Character
Map -- with the same arguments.

Gate: test/handoff-gate.sh.
---
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -3437,6 +3437,7 @@
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/cacls)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/calc)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/certutil)
+WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/charmap)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/chcp.com)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/clock)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/cmd)
--- a/configure
+++ b/configure
@@ -1659,6 +1659,7 @@
 enable_cacls
 enable_calc
 enable_certutil
+enable_charmap
 enable_chcp_com
 enable_clock
 enable_cmd
@@ -23100,6 +23101,7 @@
 wine_fn_config_makefile programs/cacls enable_cacls
 wine_fn_config_makefile programs/calc enable_calc
 wine_fn_config_makefile programs/certutil enable_certutil
+wine_fn_config_makefile programs/charmap enable_charmap
 wine_fn_config_makefile programs/chcp.com enable_chcp_com
 wine_fn_config_makefile programs/clock enable_clock
 wine_fn_config_makefile programs/cmd enable_cmd
--- a/programs/calc/handoff.c
+++ b/programs/calc/handoff.c
@@ -1,12 +1,12 @@
 /*
- * Stained Glass OS: calc.exe, mspaint.exe and snippingtool.exe
+ * Stained Glass OS: calc.exe, charmap.exe, mspaint.exe and snippingtool.exe
  *
  * Windows ships these in system32, so programs, scripts and the command line
  * start them by name with CreateProcess, which searches system32 and the PATH
  * but never App Paths. Wine has none of them. These are the system32 names;
  * each starts the program App Paths registers for its own file name (sg-shell's
- * Calculator, Paint and Snipping Tool) with the same arguments and exits, as
- * Windows' own calc.exe is a launcher for the Calculator app.
+ * Calculator, Character Map, Paint and Snipping Tool) with the same arguments
+ * and exits, as Windows' own calc.exe is a launcher for the Calculator app.
  *
  * Copyright 2026 Stained Glass OS contributors
  *
--- /dev/null
+++ b/programs/charmap/Makefile.in
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+MODULE    = charmap.exe
+IMPORTS   = advapi32 user32
+PARENTSRC = ../calc
+
+EXTRADLLFLAGS = -mwindows -municode
+
+SOURCES = \
+	handoff.c
